Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:04.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:09.10,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I don't know if this'll help right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:13.37,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,but go to the royal castle and show \Nthis to the soldiers at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:16.17,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Now you can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:19.75,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,I'm going to take my time tormenting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:25.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,All scoundrels think the same, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:33.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,38!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.80,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Have a pleasant trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:54.26,main,MERCHANT,0,0,0,,Wait. What are your names?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:57.83,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Our names aren't worth mentioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:08.01,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,On the road back to Muro, \NI saved some troubled villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:15.10,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,and defeated bandits attacking \Na merchant before safely making it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:35.63,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:38.79,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:40.73,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:44.16,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:46.59,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.82,0:01:52.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You've grown so much, Teodorico.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.27,0:02:14.53,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFEFD&\an8\fs40\c&H1B1A20&\shad0\bord4\fad(1782,1)}Always a {\c&H8971F4&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:13.38,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an8\move(20,320,330,320)\c&H303637&\3c&HECF6F5&\fs8\frz-4.09\shad0}Knight Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:28.98,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs27\3c&HF4F3FC&}Episode 6
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:28.98,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}How the {\c&H8A74F6&}One {\c&H080600&}That Got Away Fought With Her {\c&HD29E5C&}Father
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.06,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:31.02,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:32.15,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:36.24,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Six! Seven! Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:39.62,italicstop,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I was raised differently from \Nmy sisters for as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.62,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,21! 22!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:42.45,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,23! 24!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.27,0:03:45.92,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,25!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:52.72,flashback,INSTRUCTOR 1,0,0,0,,She's mastered forms one \Nthrough 25 at the age of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:54.28,flashback,INSTRUCTOR 1,0,0,0,,She's a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:56.34,flashback,INSTRUCTOR 2,0,0,0,,The Annovazzi family has no boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:59.76,flashback,INSTRUCTOR 2,0,0,0,,An exception can be made so \Na girl can inherit the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:03.17,flashback,INSTRUCTOR 3,0,0,0,,We should continue teaching \Nmartial arts to Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:05.65,flashback,ALL,0,0,0,,Sir! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:11.23,flashback,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,True...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:15.90,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(524,30)\fs40\c&H20222A&\3c&HF7F6F9&\shad0\bord4\fad(187,1)}BOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:15.90,flashback,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Maria, you'll be\Nthe Annovazzi family heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:18.17,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yes, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:26.26,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,As they were no longer potential heirs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:32.71,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,my four sisters trained to be ladies \Nand found suitors in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:39.38,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, even at my sisters' parties, \NI was always surrounded by adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:43.65,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Having previously only \Nstudied martial arts,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:47.99,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I began attending school \Nfor nobles in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.85,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,On my long-awaited first day of school...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:53.27,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Good morn...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:54.75,flashback,LADY 1,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:56.20,flashback,LADY 2,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:59.24,flashback,LADY 1,0,0,0,,Your makeup looks splendid again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:03.49,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,When I saw the other ladies my age,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:07.85,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I realized how unrefined \Nmy upbringing had been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:09.25,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(475,25)\c&H2500B5&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\fad(396,1)\fs25}SHOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:12.66,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,So Aida's not the only one \Nwho says, "How do you do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:12.66,top,AIDA,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:17.26,main,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Nice, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:20.90,top,MALE STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,Score us a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.80,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,None of the boys fancied me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:22.38,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Instead, they treated me like one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:30.68,flashback,FEMALE STUDENT,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:34.02,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Every day, girls shrieked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:38.82,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,But as a duke's heir, I still had suitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:42.53,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,They were obviously only \Ninterested in my title, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.86,0:05:44.75,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,That's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:46.03,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:48.69,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm having a little brother or sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:49.70,flashback,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:55.46,flashback,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,You'll be a big sister, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:59.32,flashback,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,Would you prefer a brother or a sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:03.01,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to have either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:12.28,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Several months after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:20.84,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,He's so soft and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:28.78,flashback,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,F-Fantastic! I have an heir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:34.79,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H2F31CE&\3c&H281986&\shad0d}WHACK WHACK {\c&H4DEDFE&\3c&H30A0C1&}THUD THUD POW
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.67,flashback,SANDRA,0,0,0,,You meathead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:31.73,flashback,NINA,0,0,0,,Be more considerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.73,0:06:32.76,flashback,GIONNA,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:32.76,overlap,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.47,flashback,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,How dare you treat your \Nown father this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.47,0:06:37.79,flashback,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Ow! Ow, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:48.98,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hold on. Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:07:03.02,flashback,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,The Annovazzi family's martial arts \Nare for protecting those dear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:11.63,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll protect you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:14.74,flashback,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:21.04,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Since little Teodorico was born, \NI wasn't the heir anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:23.29,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,But honestly, I was glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:26.03,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,After all, I'd always wanted to \Nbe treated like a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.03,0:07:28.64,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,just like the other ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:26.72,top,MALE STUDENT,0,0,0,,Let me carry that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:27.71,top,LADY,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.13,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs15\c&H544962&\bord4\shad0\fad(315,1)\3c&HFFFFFF&}Let me carry\N that for you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.14,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\c&H544962&\bord4\shad0\fad(315,1)\3c&HFFFFFF&}Oh, my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:34.01,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I had a late start, but if I \Nstudied like them, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:52.72,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I'd find a lovely fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:08:00.33,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Sister? What's wrong, Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:02.88,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:05.13,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.49,0:08:06.81,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:14.39,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,It's not like me to feel anxious \Nabout seeing my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:21.23,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Will they be truly glad about \Nmy engagement to Prince Renato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:29.70,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:34.58,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Idea, Nina,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:39.04,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sandra, Gionna, and Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.55,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\i1\an9\c&H2E151B&\3c&HDFC3CA&\bord1.5\shad3\fs25}RRRUMBLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.55,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\i1\an7\c&H2E151B&\3c&HDFC3CA&\bord1.5\shad3}RRRUMBLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:48.38,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come inside right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:52.22,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I mistook Macchio for you \Nand lifted him instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You didn't notice before then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.19,0:08:59.23,main,GIONNA,0,0,0,,Forget that, Mimi. We're feasting tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:03.68,main,IDEA,0,0,0,,Crown Prince Bartolomey of Muro is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:05.63,overlap,BART,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Bart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:05.63,main,NINA,0,0,0,,You'd better thank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:08.05,main,NINA,0,0,0,,When the letter from Rubini arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:11.15,main,NINA,0,0,0,,he's the one \Nwho certified its authenticity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:13.54,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,He's just so considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:16.32,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,He has to be as Nina's husband, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:18.45,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Did you say something, Sandra?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.97,main,GIONNA,0,0,0,,Mom, do we have any meat pies today?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:24.88,main,MIMIM MOM,0,0,0,,Of course. I baked five just for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:27.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This feels like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:31.26,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't you have something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:34.16,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, Prince Renato and I—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:35.43,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:42.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm home, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:50.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I brought gifts for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:53.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aida recommended some \Nperfumed oils and soaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.32,main,IDEA,0,0,0,,Mimi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:59.00,main,IDEA,0,0,0,,Our Mimi's sitting with her legs together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:01.79,main,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,I never thought this day would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:04.37,main,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,She's still drinking \Nvegetable juice, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:07.65,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Do you drink vegetable \Njuice in Rubini, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.65,0:10:12.34,main,GIONNA,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't believe you \Ncaught the crown prince of Rubini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:15.81,main,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,Prince Renato is \Na wonderful man, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:18.01,main,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to meeting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:19.84,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:23.09,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,I don't want to meet the crown \Nprince of a great kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:24.31,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,He'll see right through us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:28.22,main,IDEA,0,0,0,,True. We don't know how to entertain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:32.59,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Our own kingdom's crown prince \Nis right here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:35.07,main,BART,0,0,0,,The house is so lively \Nwhen everyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.82,main,BART,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:42.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Lord Bartolomey, \Nhave you met Prince Renato?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:44.38,main,BART,0,0,0,,We've said hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:47.55,main,BART,0,0,0,,He was beautiful and sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:53.67,main,BART,0,0,0,,But if he chose you, \Nhe must be more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.08,0:10:58.62,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He's right. There's something wrong \Nwith Prince Renato and his kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:01.89,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,for accepting me as their future queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:06.40,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I can't fill Aida's shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:10.54,main,BART,0,0,0,,Maybe he chose you because \Nthere's nobody like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.54,0:11:13.67,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's like you read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:19.25,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Nina, I wanted to ask you \Nabout marrying a crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:23.04,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Your wedding is on a much larger scale. \NI'm not sure I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:28.17,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd be drawn \Nto a man weaker than yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:29.83,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He's not weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:33.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Prince Renato's movements are elegant, \Nbut I can't seem to avoid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.63,0:11:37.22,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sometimes he's standing \Nbehind me before I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:38.45,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:41.47,main,NINA,0,0,0,,He can sneak up on you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:46.05,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He smiles all the time, but he's \Nso strong, I can't break his grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:48.73,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I've never met anyone like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:51.23,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:54.87,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I've heard of a legendary \Ngroup of assassins
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:59.24,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,with no gaps in their defenses \Nwho can kill instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:02.81,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Perhaps Prince Renato \Nis descended from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:06.08,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Summon all the instructors \Nfirst thing in the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:07.64,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,We must prepare for a counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:10.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.57,0:12:15.21,main,BART,0,0,0,,Sir, you mustn't kill the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:13.17,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&HD249BD&\3c&HA6349B&\shad0\pos(276,136)}POUR
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:13.67,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&HD249BD&\3c&HA6349B&\shad0\pos(266,120)}POUR
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:14.17,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&HD249BD&\3c&HA6349B&\shad0\pos(276,136)}POUR
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:14.88,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&HD249BD&\3c&HA6349B&\shad0\pos(267,121)\fad(1,438)}POUR
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:18.43,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs30\i1\fad(188,235)\c&HEAB882&\3c&HA78168&\shad0}SIT...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.49,0:12:18.93,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.43,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:25.48,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,He's coming to negotiate a peace treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:28.18,main,BART,0,0,0,,He's coming to pay his respects \Nbefore the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:29.23,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Wedding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:31.34,main,GIONNA,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is Dad acting weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:33.82,main,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,He's still reeling from Mimi's engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.49,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,He's always weird, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:41.32,main,TEO,0,0,0,,I wanna play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:45.30,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sure, once you've finished \Nall the meat on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:47.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Drink your vegetable juice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:48.58,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:13:00.51,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Good boy, Teo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:04.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Let's head outside before it gets dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:06.64,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Wait, Mimi! I'm not done talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.81,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The ogre's getting angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:11.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:15.04,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:24.95,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\c&H141824&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an1\frz11.98\pos(367,247)}Always a {\c&H8873F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:28.04,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,There! Up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:29.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:35.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Teo, 13!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:36.95,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:42.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:45.04,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Can we do Giant Swing next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:55.77,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,We're not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:14:00.14,main,TEO,0,0,0,,I wanna sleep with you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.14,0:14:02.17,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sure, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:03.61,main,TEO,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:05.13,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Can you do the thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.95,main,TEO,0,0,0,,The funny face counting song.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:10.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sure, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:18.46,sign_ComicSansMS,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(290,60)\c&H412D41&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\fs22}"That"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:15.63,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I can't tell anyone "that" was the \Nstart of my romance with the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:18.46,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I should tell him \Nto keep it under wraps, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:22.76,main,TEO,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.67,0:14:27.18,main,TEO,0,0,0,,I can still only do up to form 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:29.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You can do 18 already? That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:30.91,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:36.87,main,TEO,0,0,0,,I heard you could do up to 25 \Nwhen you were my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.87,0:14:39.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:41.90,main,TEO,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'll try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:46.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You overheard me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:54.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Soon you'll grow a lot bigger \Nand stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:57.10,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Really? I'll get bigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:14:58.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Of course you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:14:59.67,main,TEO,0,0,0,,As big as Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:06.97,sign_TimesNewRoman,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H88DAFF&\3c&H4E3ED2&\shad0\bord3}Portrait of Father At Three Years Old
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:05.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Probably, genetically speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:06.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,though it makes me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:12.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,May your legs grow \Nas long as Prince Renato's!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:13.77,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs25\c&HCEE4FA&\bord0\shad0\pos(546,161)}RUB RUB RUB
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:13.77,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs25c&HCEE4FA&\bord0\shad0\pos(100,9)}RUB RUB RUB
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:13.77,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Who's Renato?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:16.37,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That man who's going to be my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:17.32,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Is he strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:20.65,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Someday he'll be the most important \Nman in the Kingdom of Rubini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:25.49,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H72FEFD&\3c&H126AB6&\bord1.5\4c&H1D58AE&\shad1\pos(322,18)}CHATTER CHATTER
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:22.78,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.72,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:29.31,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He's really handsome and really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:30.49,sign_Arial,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(70,20)\c&H24212A&\3c&HD5B0C5&\shad0\bord4}RRRUMBLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.49,0:15:33.50,sign_Arial,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H24212A&\3c&HD5B0C5&\shad0\bord3}RRRUMBLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:35.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Teo, could you go back inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:36.39,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.62,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I can see you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:49.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Do you want to play with us, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.49,0:15:51.39,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,N-No, of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:57.78,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I thought I'd catch you unawares \Nto see if you're been training properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:07.74,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Are you really marrying \Nthe crown prince of Rubini?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:11.66,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.69,0:16:18.26,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I can't imagine an unrefined girl \Nlike you becoming a crown princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:21.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I can't say I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.39,0:16:25.30,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,On your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:28.43,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,In a foreign kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:37.55,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,You'll be living \Nan unfamiliar life all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:41.48,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Dad's blows are always \Nso heavy and quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:46.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I don't understand \Nwhat you're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:48.94,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Our kingdoms may be neighbors,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:51.82,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,but I won't be there \Nto help you right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:55.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm not alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:05.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I have the prince and Aida. \NEveryone's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:09.92,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Everyone at the royal castle \Nprotects me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:15.13,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,You allow yourself to be protected \Nby people weaker than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:17.88,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:24.40,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Because I'll protect them so they \Ncan protect me with peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:32.28,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Besides, I was raised to be strong \Nenough to protect those dear to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:35.28,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(330,80,305,30)\c&H454CED&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\fad(1,477)}SMILE!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:36.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,by none other than you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:44.44,flashback,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,The Annovazzi family's martial arts \Nare for protecting those dear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.65,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:55.04,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:02.81,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,that's what makes you an Annovazzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:07.42,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Especially since Teo was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:12.12,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,my father's always been \Na bit hesitant around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:15.53,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,But in reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:19.07,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,he's arrogant and condescending,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:23.88,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,with a big voice and bigger attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:29.35,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,and laughs with a mouth so wide \Nhe'll swallow you whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:34.74,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Then let them protect \Nyou without reservations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.73,0:18:37.67,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:40.05,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:46.54,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I told you to find a promising catch, \Nbut you went way beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:52.28,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,The second or third son of a middling \Nfamily would've been good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:55.66,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sorry. I guess I wasn't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:19:01.08,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,I never meant for you \Nto marry someone from abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.05,0:19:05.17,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You know, Prince Renato said
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:10.92,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,he'll have this hairpin remade \Nbased on the royal crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:14.07,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But I promise I'll keep the four rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.07,0:19:16.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,After all, it'd be meaningless without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:26.64,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,We finally settled on this design \Nafter much disagreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:34.60,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,It may change someday, \Nbut I'll treasure it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:38.51,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,After all, I'm proud to have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:44.48,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I met the prince because you \Nallowed me to study abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.41,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.01,0:19:49.01,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:55.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I hope you'll give the prince \Na proper welcome when he arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.37,0:19:57.70,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,You can count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:06.33,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.33,0:20:08.41,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I have urgent news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:09.85,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:12.07,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:15.32,flashback,VILLAGER,0,0,0,,Are you Lord Raimondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:18.29,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,What? Uh, yes. Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.29,0:20:22.33,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Some villagers from Navarro \Narrived seeking my intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:25.91,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,They had a letter of introduction \Nfrom Count Falzone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:30.79,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,They also gave me \NLady Maria's handkerchief,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:33.21,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,which had these dark red stains.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.85,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Dark red stains?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.85,0:20:38.79,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I thought it was blood \Nand had it analyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.34,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,It was grape juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.39,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Grape...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.27,0:20:45.42,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,She must've been eating grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:47.79,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Casually giving villagers \Na stained handkerchief
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:49.94,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,sounds like something she'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:56.36,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,According to the villagers, \Nshe introduced them to Count Falzone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:59.95,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,and instructed them \Nto seek an audience with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:04.29,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Do Mimi and Count Falzone \Nshare any kind of connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:09.87,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Lady Maria saved a merchant wagon \Nhired by the count from bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:13.54,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I see. So, what do the villagers want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:22.93,sign_Arial,SIGN RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\c&H3F644F&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(505,70)\fs16\bord3\blur4\shad0}Villager
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:22.93,sign_Arial,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\c&H634E85&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(148,74)\fs16\fscx86\blur4\shad0}Chief's Daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:20.55,sign_Arial,SIGN CENTER,0,0,0,,{\c&H7D4756&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs16\fscx86\blur4\pos(336,253)\bord3\fsp5\fad(307,105)\shad0}Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:20.47,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Their chief's daughter is missing, \Nbut their lord refuses to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:22.93,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Lady Maria helped them when they \Nwere at their wit's end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:28.81,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,That's more or less what I was \Ntold by a man with a heavy accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:31.41,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Who's the lord of Navarro Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.41,0:21:32.81,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Count Nardi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:36.26,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Raimondo, we must leave this instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:38.07,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I've already made the arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.07,0:21:40.74,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Then I'll get to see Mimi soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:43.70,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,What? Are you planning \Nto travel all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.67,0:21:50.79,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,The village chief's daughter \Nis missing. We must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:53.43,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,You're grinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:54.92,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,265)\fs24}To Be Continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:09.01,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Translation: Sho Stifler\NTiming: Mariana Martinez
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:13.39,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Editing: Alicia Ashby\NQuality Control: Ashley Barboza
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.39,0:22:17.73,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Final Quality Control: Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.72,0:23:29.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The queen dowager's doggy is really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.38,0:23:31.24,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I used to have a pet, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.24,0:23:33.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It was cute and helped me practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.52,0:23:37.24,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It was a bear and not a dog,\Nbut then Mom found out about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.24,0:23:39.40,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, I spoke my mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:39.94,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs19\3c&HF4F3FC&}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:39.94,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0\fscx88}The {\c&H8B74F6&\fs27}Fists {\fs22\c&H20222A&}of the {\c&HCD9F59&}One {\c&H20222A&}That Got Away
